+<h3><a name="ICAST_QUESTIONABLE_UNSIGNED_RIGHT_SHIFT">BSHIFT: Unsigned right shift cast to short/byte (ICAST_QUESTIONABLE_UNSIGNED_RIGHT_SHIFT)</a></h3>
