+29	jdk1.6.0-b46	"Thu Aug 04 03:02:48 EDT 2005"	15936	951355	13	1	1	32	1230	110	1244
+30	jdk1.6.0-b47	"Thu Aug 11 03:18:56 EDT 2005"	15964	952387	163	8	7	20	1217	143	1388
