+33	jdk1.6.0-b50	"Thu Sep 01 01:52:40 EDT 2005"	16287	974937	19	27	16	7	1376	171	1422
+34	jdk1.6.0-b51	"Thu Sep 08 01:55:36 EDT 2005"	16362	979377	1	15	3	0	1419	194	1435
