+Returns FcFalse if the file is already locked, else returns FcTrue and
+leaves the file locked.
+@@
+
+@RET@           FcChar8 *
+@FUNC@          FcAtomicNewFile
+@TYPE1@         FcAtomic *                      @ARG1@          atomic
+@PURPOSE@	return new temporary file name 
+@DESC@
